 | environment = {{floor|Basement}}{{floor|Cellar}}{{floor|Burning Basement}}<br>{{floor|Downpour}}{{floor|Dross}}<br>{{room|boss}}<br>{{dlc|nr}}{{room|challenge}}
 | behavior    = Walks towards Isaac, dealing contact damage. Usually turns into a {{e|Pacer}} or a {{e|Gusher}} upon death.
}}

'''Gapers''' walk towards Isaac by the most direct route possible. They will actively path around obstacles and other enemies that block their path to Isaac. Upon death, there is a 50% chance they leave behind a {{e|Pacer}} or a {{e|Gusher}}; if this check succeeds, there is a 33% chance it leaves behind a Gusher, otherwise it leaves behind a Pacer (in other words, 1 in 3 Gapers leave behind a Pacer on death, and 1/6 leave behind a Gusher; 50% of them will leave nothing).

==== Notes ====
All Gaper variations will never leave behind an enemy on death if their HP is dropped to -25 or less in one instance (i.e., by using a Bomb). The {{e|Level 2 Gaper}} is an exception and will do so regardless.

